  "name": "Blazing Hippogryph and X-53 Touring Rocket are ground mounts usable below level 60 in Stormwind (#10460)",
  "contract": [
    "Blazing Hippogryph (spell 74856, item 54069) and X-53 Touring Rocket (spell 75973, item 54860), both Recruit",
    "a Friend rewards, are ground mounts. AscensionCollectibles::MountWrappers maps each wrapper to the client mount",
    "spells 74854 and 74855 (Hippogryph) and 75957 (Rocket), which SpellInfoCorrections strips of their flight aura and",
    "SPELL_ATTR4_ONLY_FLYING_AREAS, so the client keeps their icons. spell_ascension_local_mount selects by riding skill:",
    "Apprentice 75 gives 60% and Journeyman 150 and above give 100%. The generic spell_gen_mount bindings are removed",
    "because they cancelled the mount. Both items drop their level 60 and riding 225 requirements, so a level 20 rider",
    "carries and uses them. The Rocket wrapper no longer refuses the cast outside flying areas such as Stormwind, where",
    "the report was made. No flight grant is sent in Azeroth even at Artisan riding."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 120000,
